    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43033" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσχάρ-ιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσχάρα</span> : <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>pan of coals,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				516
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stand, platform,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.41.4
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.91
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>cradle for launching ships,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Callix.
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>eschar,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				51.42.3
			</span></i>.</div>
